    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29117" root="عسل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسْلٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْسَلٌ</span>, below. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسْلًا لَهُ</span> means

<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْسًا لَهُ</span> [i. e. <i>May he stumble and fall;</i> &amp;c.; (see
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعس</span>;) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسْلًا</span> being app. an inf. n., of which,
in this sense, the verb is not mentioned]: (O,
K:) [or <i>may he be reviled;</i> for] it is said that
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَسْلُ</span> signifies <i>the reviling in blaming.</i> (TA.)

